vidence that misses the target remains durable but is not reusable."},{"id":"fail-closed-revalidation","statement":"Reuse requires an exact compatibility-digest match, unexpired validity, valid source and artifact digests, and a derived drift witness within its sealed tolerance. Missing, accessor-backed, inherited, malformed, stale, mismatched, re-signed, or out-of-tolerance evidence requires fresh comparator capture."},{"id":"independent-not-paired-statistics","statement":"A Lagrange iteration joined to a stored comparator must use an explicitly independent-sample effect and carry both uncertainty sources. It must never label block ordinals as contemporaneous pairs or reuse paired-effect terminology."},{"id":"no-lagrange-setup-dependency","statement":"PostgreSQL comparator capture must not start or depend on the Lagrange cluster, Lagrange PostgreSQL ingress service, Request Cell placement, or Binding lifecycle. Lagrange setup failure must not invalidate or force recapture of an otherwise compatible comparator."}],"verificationTemplates":["admission-gating","adversarial-js-intrinsics","harness-fidelity"],"frontierIds":["comparative-efficiency-postgresql-comparator-reuse-main"]}}
